{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nThe Files page's preview pane is awkward for reading text files:\n\n- `/` search does not work — the `search` preset only lives on `dir_list` (file-name search); the preview pane implements neither `collect_search_matches` nor `jump_to_match`\n- No horizontal scroll: long lines are clipped on the right with no way to see the rest (vertical `scroll` only, no wrapping either)\n- `h` / `Left` are bound to Back (focus the file list), while the diff view uses `h`/`l` = ScrollLeft/ScrollRight — the same keys mean different things on different pages\n\nThe building blocks already exist: `core::search` (`SearchMatch` rows/cols, `n`/`N`, highlights) and the diff view's `scroll.x` are the precedent; the preview pane just needs the same treatment.\n\n## Tasks\n\n- [ ] Horizontal scroll: add `scroll_x` like the diff view and rebind `h`/`Left`/`l`/`Right` to ScrollLeft/ScrollRight (Back remains reachable via `Esc` / `Tab`)\n- [ ] Content search: add `preset \"search\"` to `pane \"preview\"` and implement `collect_search_matches` / `jump_to_match` (diff-view style: match highlights + `n`/`N`; scroll vertically and horizontally so the current match is visible)\n- [ ] Search what is shown: the rendered lines in markdown render mode, the raw lines in raw mode; image previews are out of scope\n- [ ] Help + key tables (README / README.ja, the guide's Files chapter and Config Reference)\n- [ ] Update `tape/demo-files.tape` and re-record the GIF\n- [ ] Tests: match collection, scroll-into-view on jump, hscroll clamping\n\n## Note\n\n`h` / `Left` change meaning (Back → ScrollLeft). `Esc` and `Tab` already return to the file list, so no escape route is lost, and the keys become consistent with the diff view.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-07T07:24:12Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":162,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Files: content search and horizontal scroll in the preview pane"}
